# The dashboard's only environment variable.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* at BUILD time, not at run time, so this has to be set in
# the hosting project's environment BEFORE the build -- changing it afterwards
# does nothing until the next deployment.  Unset, ui/src/api.js falls back to
# http://localhost:8000, which in a deployed dashboard means every request
# fails with the browser's own message naming that address (which is the
# intended failure, not a silent one).
#
# No trailing slash: api.js concatenates `${API_BASE}${path}`.
# This origin's counterpart is FLOATCHAT_ORIGINS on the API project -- the two
# have to name each other or the browser blocks the call at the CORS check.
VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api.vercel.app
